    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy are delighted to present this recently refurbished four-bedroom terraced townhouse, ideally located in a convenient village setting. Bright and spacious accommodation comprises living room, open-plan kitchen/dining room, utility, shower room, home office, four bedrooms including one ensuite, and family bathroom. A standout feature is the private rear garden, enclosed by high natural stone walls and featuring traditional stone outbuildings, with double gates providing valuable vehicular access. Presented in excellent condition and offering vacant possession immediately, this is a superb opportunity for those seeking a spacious, ready-to-move-into home with excellent outdoor space. Viewing strongly recommended. Contact REA Seamus Carthy today. \n\nOutside\nFronting onto Public footpath, to the rear, we have private garden, bounded by high natural stone walls with Traditional Stone Outbuildings together with double gates offering vehicular access."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Village Setting\nGood Condition\nVacant Possession Available immediately\n4 Bedrooms,\nStone Outbuildings,\nPrivate Back Garden \nRear Vehicular Access\n\nAccommodation comprises Living Room, Open plan Kitchen and Dining room, Utility, Shower room, office, 4 bedrooms incl one ensuite and a Family Bathroom. \n All main services to include, Water, Electricty and Waste water. \n Local amenities include village shop, Bar, Church, national primary school. Highly convenient also to the larger towns of Castlerea, Roscommon, Boyle, Carrick on Shannon."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 117078758, Energy Performance Indicator: 161.67kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Set Within Ballinagare Village, on what was the main N5 Primary Route. N5 road By pass of the Village currently under construction with schedule date of completion 2027. Once complete. the said by pass is expected to transform the village by removing a projected 70% of through traffic."
      }
